<<
/A 1497 0 R
/Alt (Panel A displays a line graph showing cumulative patients with bradycardia after IVMP administration, rising sharply to 38 cases \(seventy-nine point two percent\) by day three, then plateauing. Panel B is a bar graph with individual data points comparing heart rate across five time points: pre-IVMP, first, second, and third bradycardia episodes, and twenty-four hours before discharge; statistical significance is noted between groups, including p = 0.0405, p < 0.001.)
/K [22 1498 0 R]
/P 107 0 R
/Pg 41 0 R
/S /Figure
/T (FIGURE 2)
/Type /StructElem
>>
