/A 1504 0 R
/Alt (Four-panel figure on bradycardia. Panel A: box plot shows time since first IVMP across first, second, and third bradycardia episodes, increasing with each event. Panel B: box plot shows duration of bradycardia decreases from first to third episode. Panel C: stacked bar graph displays number of patients experiencing bradycardia by episode and duration range, most patients have durations with less than 4 days. Panel D: line graph compares systolic and diastolic blood pressure at admission and after each bradycardia, showing slight increases after the first episode.)
